{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The thrill of spiking in volleyball. Why don't you try it out?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by an indie developer who loves volleyball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sports game made after numerous trial and error to contain the appeal of volleyball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Try out various volleyball strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quicks, pipes, open attacks, and fast tempo attacks in a 3v3 volleyball match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve your greatest spike in diverse scenarios in your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Immersive gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the immersion of actually playing on the court yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by controlling only 1 player on the court from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Appealing storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the attractive characters that appear in the universe of The Spike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Siwoo with his journey in both volleyball and inner growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Diverse volleyball contents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is normal volleyball boring for you? Enjoy different types of volleyball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >contents such as tournament, colosseum, beach volleyball, and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983810?t=1760584948","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983810?t=1760584948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983810/403a856f6630ee0a06f79030fc14bf0213339b9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760584948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983810/403a856f6630ee0a06f79030fc14bf0213339b9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760584948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The thrill of spiking in volleyball. Why don't you try it out?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by an indie developer who loves volleyball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sports game made after numerous trial and error to contain the appeal of volleyball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Try out various volleyball strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quicks, pipes, open attacks, and fast tempo attacks in a 3v3 volleyball match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve your greatest spike in diverse scenarios in your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Immersive gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the immersion of actually playing on the court yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by controlling only 1 player on the court from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Appealing storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the attractive characters that appear in the universe of The Spike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Siwoo with his journey in both volleyball and inner growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Diverse volleyball contents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is normal volleyball boring for you? Enjoy different types of volleyball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >contents such as tournament, colosseum, beach volley